 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nAlbion Components Ltd                                           MASTER SERVICES\n221 Baker Street, LS1 4DY Leeds, United Kingdom                         AGREEMENT\nVAT No: GB157875087\nReg No: GB-283865\n\nFROM                                                             BILL TO\n\nAlbion Components Ltd                                            Thamesview Logistics Ltd\n221 Baker Street                                                 221 Baker Street\nLS1 4DY Leeds                                                    M1 2AB Manchester\nUnited Kingdom                                                   United Kingdom\nVAT: GB157875087\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 17/05/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Albion Components Ltd, with its registered office at 221 Baker Street, Leeds (\"Party A\"), and Thamesview\nLogistics Ltd, with its registered office at 221 Baker Street, Manchester (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of England and Wales.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A    Albion Components Ltd / Oliver Bennett\nParty B    Thamesview Logistics Ltd / Amelia Clarke\nDate       17/05/2026",
